.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "L34-36,58-64", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "skill_concept_two_deployment_moments", "label": "Two separate deployment moments: day 3 (16.1+16.2) and day 10 (16.3)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "L16-27", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "We deploy the deploy line before the product; in the reference project deploy came at the end so the session never finished and the trainer completed the rest himself, with any breakage hitting at the worst time."}, {"id": "skill_split_vercel_mcp_vs_cli", "label": "Tool split: Vercel MCP manages and diagnoses, the CLI deploys and sets env vars", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "L31-38", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The MCP has no environment-variable tools yet, so the two tools are used together, neither replacing the other."}, {"id": "skill_rule_root_dir_and_env_before_deploy", "label": "Rule: set the root directory and add production env vars before deploying, not after", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "L61-62", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Skipping this deploys successfully then the product breaks at runtime."}, {"id": "deploying_skill_vercel_mcp_connect_oauth", "label": "\u0631\u0628\u0637 Vercel MCP \u0645\u0631\u0651\u0629 \u0648\u0627\u062d\u062f\u0629 \u2190 /mcp \u2190 \u062a\u0623\u0643\u064a\u062f \u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062a\u0635\u0641\u0651\u062d (OAuth)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "L46-50",